      /*
       * The copy's own room, cut to a fifth at round 3 (owner: both paddings around "every
       * release" are "too big ... cut the paddings to 20%"). Measured before and after
       * rather than dialled by eye: 219px above the copy became 44, and 300px below it
       * became 60 - then doubled to 120 at round 4 (owner: "double the bottom padding of
       * the section").
